{"id": "22605", "title": "墨子", "author": "墨翟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 15, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/22/22605/22605s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/22/22605.htm", "intro": "墨子（约公元前468年～前376年），名翟，山东滕州人，汉族，是我国战国时期著名的思想家，墨家学派的创始人。他曾提出“兼爱”“非攻”等观点，创立墨家学说，并有《墨子》一书传世。墨学在当时影响很大，与儒家并称“显学”。", "base": "files/article/html/22/22605", "chapters": [{"title": "卷一", "file": "1657323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷二", "file": "1657324.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷三", "file": "1657325.html", "available": false}, {"title": "卷四", "file": "1657326.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷五", "file": "1657327.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷六", "file": "1657328.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷七", "file": "1657329.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷八", "file": "1657330.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷九", "file": "1657331.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十", "file": "1657332.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十一", "file": "1657333.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十二", "file": "1657334.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十三", "file": "1657335.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十四", "file": "1657336.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十五", "file": "1657337.html", "available": true}]}